{"id":"c036","number":36,"title":"我想去","label":"第三十六章 我想去","volumeId":"v2","sourceHeadingParagraph":7344,"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"第二天雨歇云收。","sourceParagraph":7345},{"type":"paragraph","text":"清晨七点刚过，厚重的云层依旧低低地压在楼宇上空，直到幕踏出宿舍楼大门，东边的天际才慢慢晕开一层淡淡的鱼肚白。昨夜的雨水在石板路面的缝隙里积出一汪汪浅浅水洼，晨风掠过，水面漾开一圈圈细碎的涟漪。教学楼前的树木抽出了初春的新芽，嫩生生的浅绿近乎泛白，被雨水浸润过的枝桠承接住微弱天光，轮廓干净柔和，仿佛被人细细描摹过一般。","sourceParagraph":7346},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕买了两个包子和一杯热豆浆，纸袋与纸杯握在掌心，暖意缓缓渗进皮肤。","sourceParagraph":7347},{"type":"paragraph","text":"走到食堂玻璃门前，他脚步下意识顿了顿。若是放在从前，他会很自然地顺手多买一份早餐。","sourceParagraph":7348},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他垂眸望着手里的纸袋，拇指无意识摩挲手机冰凉的机壳，思虑片刻，还是点亮屏幕敲下消息。","sourceParagraph":7349},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「吃早饭了吗。」","sourceParagraph":7350},{"type":"paragraph","text":"半分钟之后，旼的回复弹了出来。","sourceParagraph":7351},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「没。」","sourceParagraph":7352},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕：「我在食堂。」","sourceParagraph":7353},{"type":"paragraph","text":"几乎是转瞬便收到回话。","sourceParagraph":7354},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「等我。」","sourceParagraph":7355},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕把手机收进口袋，指尖在熄灭的屏幕上又短暂停留片刻。他退到门边靠墙而立，清晨的风顺着敞开的门缝钻进来，裹挟着雨后潮湿清冽的寒气。幕肩膀微微向内收拢，双手环握住豆浆纸杯，借着杯身的温度抵御凉意，目光望向校外的步道，脚尖漫不经心地轻轻蹭着地面潮湿的地砖。","sourceParagraph":7356},{"type":"paragraph","text":"五六分钟之后，旼快步从远处跑了过来。","sourceParagraph":7357},{"type":"paragraph","text":"看得出来起得十分仓促。","sourceParagraph":7358},{"type":"paragraph","text":"头发没有仔细梳理，右侧翘起一撮倔强的碎发，卫衣外面随意套了一件薄外套，帆布包斜挎在肩头。奔跑时鞋底碾过湿漉漉的地面，发出细碎的声响。跑到幕面前站定，她胸口微微起伏，抬手捂住唇打了一个哈欠，眼尾被困意熏出一层薄薄的水光。","sourceParagraph":7359},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕安安静静看着她。","sourceParagraph":7360},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼抬眼望向他，微微眯起惺忪的睡眼，抬手把向下滑落的包带向上提了提。","sourceParagraph":7361},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「看什么。」","sourceParagraph":7362},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你的头发。」","sourceParagraph":7363},{"type":"paragraph","text":"她茫然抬手摸向那撮翘起来的发丝，指尖来回拨弄。","sourceParagraph":7364},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「怎么了。」","sourceParagraph":7365},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕伸出手，试着把那缕翘起的头发往下按。","sourceParagraph":7366},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可他的手刚刚挪开，发丝又弹回原本的模样。","sourceParagraph":7367},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他又试了一回，依旧徒劳无功。","sourceParagraph":7368},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼就站在原地任由他反复摆弄，视线从他的手指慢慢移到他的脸上，神色从茫然慢慢染上几分无奈，终于轻声开口。","sourceParagraph":7369},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「有用吗。」","sourceParagraph":7370},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕收回手，指尖悬在半空顿了顿。","sourceParagraph":7371},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「没用。」","sourceParagraph":7372},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼面无表情地望了他两秒，唇角极细微地抽动了一下。","sourceParagraph":7373},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那你还折腾半天。」","sourceParagraph":7374},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「就是想试试看。」","sourceParagraph":7375},{"type":"paragraph","text":"她转身走向早餐窗口，走出两步又回过头瞥了他一眼，幕跟在她身后迈步上前。","sourceParagraph":7376},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你想吃点什么。」","sourceParagraph":7377},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「豆浆。」","sourceParagraph":7378},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「就只喝豆浆？」","sourceParagraph":7379},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼侧过脸看向他，眉梢微微扬起。","sourceParagraph":7380},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕连忙抬手，神色带着一点解释的意味。","sourceParagraph":7381},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我就随口问问。」","sourceParagraph":7382},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「再加一个鸡蛋。」","sourceParagraph":7383},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯。」","sourceParagraph":7384},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼自己排队买好一杯豆浆、一颗水煮鸡蛋。","sourceParagraph":7385},{"type":"paragraph","text":"两人寻了一处靠墙的座位坐下。清晨的食堂还没有完全热闹起来，蒸笼升腾起白茫茫的热气，一阵阵扑在玻璃窗上。窗口的工作人员用金属夹子夹起包子，碰撞托盘发出清脆叮当。零星的学生背着书包，一边走一边吃早饭；门口进进出出的人，手里还收拢着雨伞，明明雨已经停了，天色却依旧阴沉沉的，仿佛随时又会落下雨来。","sourceParagraph":7386},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕小口地咬着包子，动作慢条斯理。","sourceParagraph":7387},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一旁的旼在剥鸡蛋壳。","sourceParagraph":7388},{"type":"paragraph","text":"蛋壳并不完整，她蹙起眉头，指甲抠下一块碎壳，连带着一小块嫩蛋白一同撕了下来。","sourceParagraph":7389},{"type":"paragraph","text":"她的手停在半空中，垂眸盯着手里缺了一角的鸡蛋，眉心拧起浅浅的褶皱。","sourceParagraph":7390},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕将这一幕尽收眼底。","sourceParagraph":7391},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「这样会浪费。」","sourceParagraph":7392},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼抬眼看他，眼底透出一点被戳中心事的不服气。","sourceParagraph":7393},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「给你吃。」","sourceParagraph":7394},{"type":"paragraph","text":"她说着，便把沾着细碎蛋壳的那一小块蛋白朝他递过来，手腕向前伸出。","sourceParagraph":7395},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕微微皱起眉，身体稍稍向后避让。","sourceParagraph":7396},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我为什么要连壳一起吃。」","sourceParagraph":7397},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼的唇角抑制不住地微微上扬。","sourceParagraph":7398},{"type":"paragraph","text":"她收回手，耐下心，指尖一点点剔除蛋白上面残留的碎蛋壳。清理干净之后，再把那一小块蛋白推到幕面前的纸袋边上。","sourceParagraph":7399},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「现在可以了。」","sourceParagraph":7400},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕扫了一眼，伸手拿过来吃下。","sourceParagraph":7401},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼继续剥手里剩下的鸡蛋，这一回手指的动作沉稳了不少。","sourceParagraph":7402},{"type":"paragraph","text":"片刻之后，她轻声开口。","sourceParagraph":7403},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「昨天夜里，我又重新看了一遍交换项目的通知。」","sourceParagraph":7404},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕咬包子的动作骤然顿住，握着食物的手指微微收紧。","sourceParagraph":7405},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯。」","sourceParagraph":7406},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我还查了那边学院开设的全部课程。」","sourceParagraph":7407},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯。」","sourceParagraph":7408},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼把最后一点蛋壳剥落，完整的鸡蛋搁在纸杯的盖子上，她没有立刻吃下去，指腹反复摩挲着杯盖冰凉的边缘。她没有像往日紧张时那样去捻袖口，可右手的拇指，一遍遍地轻轻蹭过食指的指节，仿佛在给自己寻找一处情绪落脚的支点。","sourceParagraph":7409},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「然后呢。」幕轻声发问。","sourceParagraph":7410},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼抬起头，窗外灰白的天光映在她的瞳孔里。她安静凝视幕数秒，像是在确认，说出这句话之后，眼前的相处不会就此被撼动。","sourceParagraph":7411},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我想去。」","sourceParagraph":7412},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不是一时兴起的动心，也不是依旧摇摆不定的犹豫，是已经落定的心意。","sourceParagraph":7413},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕的心神轻轻一沉。昨夜他其实已经预想过这样的答复，也在脑海演练过自己该做出怎样的反应。可当这句话真切落入耳中，心口依旧沉甸甸地往下坠，没有尖锐的疼痛，只是一团沉甸甸的失重感慢慢漫开。","sourceParagraph":7414},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼静静望着他，手依旧放在纸杯盖上，没有把刚才的话语收回去。","sourceParagraph":7415},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕的手掌覆在豆浆杯外壁，指节被微凉的杯壁衬得泛出淡淡的青白，杯子已经褪去了刚才的滚烫暖意。","sourceParagraph":7416},{"type":"paragraph","text":"短暂几秒沉寂之后，他出声。","sourceParagraph":7417},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「已经决定好了？」","sourceParagraph":7418},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯。」","sourceParagraph":7419},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「确定吗。」","sourceParagraph":7420},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「确定。」","sourceParagraph":7421},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕轻轻点了点头，动作放得很轻，刻意不去放大肢体的起伏，生怕泄露心底那份沉甸甸的失落。","sourceParagraph":7422},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼依旧注视着他的神情。","sourceParagraph":7423},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕低下头抿了一口豆浆，液体温度已经转凉，喉结缓缓滚动。","sourceParagraph":7424},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「哦。」","sourceParagraph":7425},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼的眉尾轻轻向下压了压。","sourceParagraph":7426},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「怎么又说哦。」","sourceParagraph":7427},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕把杯子放回桌面，掌心贴着杯壁。","sourceParagraph":7428},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我在慢慢消化这件事。」","sourceParagraph":7429},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那要消化多久。」","sourceParagraph":7430},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕抬眼看向她，旼的唇角浮起浅浅笑意，眼神却十分认真，并不逼迫他立刻表现出喜悦。","sourceParagraph":7431},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕稍稍思索。","sourceParagraph":7432},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我不知道。」","sourceParagraph":7433},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那你就慢慢消化。」","sourceParagraph":7434},{"type":"paragraph","text":"她拿起鸡蛋咬下一小口，咀嚼完之后抬眼望向他，等待他继续往下说话。","sourceParagraph":7435},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕看向她。","sourceParagraph":7436},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「今天就要提交申请材料吗。」","sourceParagraph":7437},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「还没有。」","sourceParagraph":7438},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「不是已经做了决定？」","sourceParagraph":7439},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「心意定下来而已，需要上交的材料还没有全部准备妥当。」","sourceParagraph":7440},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕下意识追问。","sourceParagraph":7441},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「都需要准备些什么。」","sourceParagraph":7442},{"type":"paragraph","text":"话音落下，两人同时微微一顿，对视一眼。","sourceParagraph":7443},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕率先浅浅笑了，抬手碰了碰鼻尖。","sourceParagraph":7444},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我就是随口问问。」","sourceParagraph":7445},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我明白。」","sourceParagraph":7446},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼咬着鸡蛋，眉眼弯起，也跟着笑了。","sourceParagraph":7447},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「成绩单、申请表，一篇个人陈述，还要附上代表作品。」","sourceParagraph":7448},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「作品就是之前那部片子？」","sourceParagraph":7449},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「可以用那一部。」","sourceParagraph":7450},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「心理中心的那部吗。」","sourceParagraph":7451},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯。」","sourceParagraph":7452},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕轻轻颔首。","sourceParagraph":7453},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思绪顺着材料流程不受控制地往下延伸：去哪里打印成绩单，个人陈述大概要耗费多少时间，视频文件要不要压缩。想到一半，他及时把纷乱的念头收住，指尖在桌面上轻轻叩响一声。","sourceParagraph":7454},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼捕捉到这个细微的小动作。","sourceParagraph":7455},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你是不是已经在琢磨，要怎么过来帮我处理这些事。」","sourceParagraph":7456},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕没有否认，视线落回她手里的鸡蛋。","sourceParagraph":7457},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「有一点点。」","sourceParagraph":7458},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「不用。」","sourceParagraph":7459},{"type":"paragraph","text":"听见这两个字，幕心里并没有生出隔阂，只是继续追问。","sourceParagraph":7460},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「一点忙都不需要？」","sourceParagraph":7461},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼认真思索，指尖在鸡蛋外壳轻轻转动。","sourceParagraph":7462},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「个人陈述写完，你可以帮我通读一遍，帮我捋一捋行文。」","sourceParagraph":7463},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕点头应下。","sourceParagraph":7464},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「好。」","sourceParagraph":7465},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「剩下的，我自己来完成。」","sourceParagraph":7466},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「好。」","sourceParagraph":7467},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼把最后一口鸡蛋吃下，抬手擦干净指尖残留的碎屑。","sourceParagraph":7468},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕沉吟片刻，开口问道。","sourceParagraph":7469},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「是什么让你最后下定决心要去的。」","sourceParagraph":7470},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼擦拭手指的动作慢了下来。","sourceParagraph":7471},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「昨天夜里，我翻看完这个工作坊往届学生产出的全部作品。」","sourceParagraph":7472},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「然后呢。」","sourceParagraph":7473},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我很向往他们做的事情。」","sourceParagraph":7474},{"type":"paragraph","text":"说出这句话的时候，她整个人的状态明显变得不一样。眼眸骤然亮起来，原本松弛的坐姿微微向前倾，肩膀微微抬起，终于聊到心底真正渴求的东西。","sourceParagraph":7475},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「他们有一个长期项目，跟拍当地普通人，为期整整三个月。不是短暂采风，拍完就收尾离开，而是一次次回去，持续记录人物的生活状态。」","sourceParagraph":7476},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕安安静静地倾听。","sourceParagraph":7477},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼的手掌抬到半空，缓缓横向划过，手势描摹出一段漫长流动的时间。","sourceParagraph":7478},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「有一组学生跟踪拍摄一位修鞋老人。第一次拜访，老人沉默寡言，等到第三个月再过去，老人会主动招呼他们留下来吃饭。」","sourceParagraph":7479},{"type":"paragraph","text":"她的语速慢慢加快，眼底的光彩愈发澄澈明亮。","sourceParagraph":7480},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「还有一个选题，记录废弃的老车站。镜头不只是对准残破的建筑本身，更多的是守候在这里等车的普通人。」","sourceParagraph":7481},{"type":"paragraph","text":"说到这里，她的指尖在桌面上轻轻叩了两下。","sourceParagraph":7482},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕凝望着她，心底已经全然懂得。","sourceParagraph":7483},{"type":"paragraph","text":"她向往的，从来不是交换项目光鲜的名头，也不是为了美化自己的履历，而是发自内心地渴求这份影像记录的体验。","sourceParagraph":7484},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼讲到一半，察觉到幕一直沉默地注视着自己，语速渐渐放缓，悬在半空的手也落回桌面。","sourceParagraph":7485},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「怎么了。」","sourceParagraph":7486},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕轻轻摇头。","sourceParagraph":7487},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「没什么。」","sourceParagraph":7488},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼微微眯起眼，身体向后靠向椅面。","sourceParagraph":7489},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕修正自己的措辞，语气真诚。","sourceParagraph":7490},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「只是看得出来，你是真的很想去。」","sourceParagraph":7491},{"type":"paragraph","text":"她安静片刻，眼里的光亮没有消散，只是慢慢柔和沉淀下来。","sourceParagraph":7492},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯。」","sourceParagraph":7493},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕低头吃完手里剩下的包子。","sourceParagraph":7494},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心口那份沉甸甸的失重感依旧盘踞不散，可与此同时，心底又滋生出另一重复杂的感受，混杂着失落，也混杂着为她而生的期许。","sourceParagraph":7495},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中午，旼便去学院领取了申请的纸质表格。","sourceParagraph":7496},{"type":"paragraph","text":"下午三点，她抱着一叠整理好的纸质材料走进图书馆，幕已经坐在他们常坐的靠窗位置等候。","sourceParagraph":7497},{"type":"paragraph","text":"远远便能看见她手里那只硬质透明文件袋，边角坚硬，走路的时候轻轻磕碰着帆布包。走到桌边，她先低头确认桌面干净平整，才把背包卸下，动作小心翼翼，生怕袋内的纸张折出褶皱。","sourceParagraph":7498},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼落座，把整套材料平铺摆到桌面上。","sourceParagraph":7499},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕垂眸扫过。","sourceParagraph":7500},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「进度这么快。」","sourceParagraph":7501},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「老师建议，有想法就尽早着手准备。」","sourceParagraph":7502},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯。」","sourceParagraph":7503},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼抽出申请表，指尖按住纸张的边缘。表格上排布着一长串需要填写的栏目：姓名、学号、专业、联系方式，交换志愿。","sourceParagraph":7504},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕扫过纸面。","sourceParagraph":7505},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「已经填完一半了。」","sourceParagraph":7506},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯，唯独这一栏，我不知道该怎么落笔。」","sourceParagraph":7507},{"type":"paragraph","text":"她的指尖点在【申请理由】那一处，下方只预留了短短三行空白。","sourceParagraph":7508},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕看向表格。","sourceParagraph":7509},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「不过三行的篇幅，还会觉得难写吗。」","sourceParagraph":7510},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「就是篇幅太短。」","sourceParagraph":7511},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那你原本打算写多长。」","sourceParagraph":7512},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼从帆布包里取出另外一张写满字迹的草稿纸，纸面密密麻麻写满文字。","sourceParagraph":7513},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕稍稍一怔。","sourceParagraph":7514},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼把草稿纸推到他面前，神色郑重，如同递交一份正式文稿。","sourceParagraph":7515},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「这些想法，我全都想写进去。」","sourceParagraph":7516},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕接过纸张，开篇便铺展开对于纪录片创作、观察视角、日常经验、影像之中真实感的思考。","sourceParagraph":7517},{"type":"paragraph","text":"读到第三行，幕抬眼望向她。","sourceParagraph":7518},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「这真的是申请理由的草稿？」","sourceParagraph":7519},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「不然你以为是什么。」","sourceParagraph":7520},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「读起来很像课程论文的摘要。」","sourceParagraph":7521},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼的眉头微微蹙起，身体微微前倾。","sourceParagraph":7522},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「真的这么像？」","sourceParagraph":7523},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「确实很像。」","sourceParagraph":7524},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「哪些句子有这个问题。」","sourceParagraph":7525},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕拿起笔，依次点出对应的语句。","sourceParagraph":7526},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼的脸色一点点垮下来，嘴角微微向下垂落。","sourceParagraph":7527},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「也不全都是吧。」","sourceParagraph":7528},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕克制住笑意，指节轻轻敲了敲纸页的边缘。","sourceParagraph":7529},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「大半部分都是。」","sourceParagraph":7530},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼向后靠回椅背，双臂环抱在胸前，目光依旧落在那页草稿纸上。","sourceParagraph":7531},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那你来帮我写。」","sourceParagraph":7532},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕立刻轻轻摇头。","sourceParagraph":7533},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「这是你的申请，不该由我代笔。」","sourceParagraph":7534},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那帮我梳理梳理思路总可以。」","sourceParagraph":7535},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕重新低头细读整篇草稿，来回翻看正反两面，试着寻找更加贴合心境的切入角度。","sourceParagraph":7536},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「早上你和我聊起的那些故事。」","sourceParagraph":7537},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼眼里带着几分疑惑。","sourceParagraph":7538},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「哪些。」","sourceParagraph":7539},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「修鞋的老人，还有废弃老车站那一段。」","sourceParagraph":7540},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼凝神望向他。","sourceParagraph":7541},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕缓缓说道。","sourceParagraph":7542},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「写下你内心真正向往这份项目的缘由就够了。」","sourceParagraph":7543},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我草稿里面写的就是向往。」","sourceParagraph":7544},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「可你的文字更多是在论证，你足够匹配这个项目。」","sourceParagraph":7545},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼陷入沉默，环在胸前的手臂缓缓放下，指尖轻轻落在桌面。","sourceParagraph":7546},{"type":"paragraph","text":"图书馆周遭安安静静。午后云层散开一小块，阳光穿透玻璃窗洒落进来，窗玻璃上残留的雨渍已经风干，留下一片片泛白的水痕。窗边绿萝新生的嫩叶朝着光亮的方向舒展，昨夜停留在叶片上的水珠早已消散无踪。","sourceParagraph":7547},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼垂眸凝视满满一页密密麻麻的文字，片刻之后，指腹轻轻抚过纸上的墨迹。","sourceParagraph":7548},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「这两者之间，有区别吗。」","sourceParagraph":7549},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「当然有。」","sourceParagraph":7550},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「区别在哪里。」","sourceParagraph":7551},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕仔细斟酌措辞。","sourceParagraph":7552},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「一种是拼命拿出证据，证明自己配得上这份机会。另一种，只是坦白心底那份真切的渴望。」","sourceParagraph":7553},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼的指尖骤然顿住，抬眼看向他，仿佛心底某个角落被这句话轻轻触动。","sourceParagraph":7554},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕心底隐隐生出似曾相识的感触。想见便是想见，想去便是想去，并不是每一份向往，都要预先搜集一堆理由，来证明这份渴望合乎情理。","sourceParagraph":7555},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼低下头，把写满长篇论述的草稿整个翻到背面，露出大片空白。她重新握住笔，指节微微收紧，落下第一行字迹：我想学习如何长时间地看一个人。","sourceParagraph":7556},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写完这一句，她停下笔静坐不动。","sourceParagraph":7557},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕望着纸面。","sourceParagraph":7558},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「这一句写得很好。」","sourceParagraph":7559},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼没有抬头，耳尖却悄悄染上一层淡淡的绯红色。","sourceParagraph":7560},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「少说两句。」","sourceParagraph":7561},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕浅浅地笑出声。","sourceParagraph":7562},{"type":"paragraph","text":"她继续往下书写，字迹算不上漂亮，落笔却沉稳笃定，刚好填满表格预留的三行空白。","sourceParagraph":7563},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼久久凝视自己写下的文字，指尖停留在末尾句号的旁边，没有继续增补。","sourceParagraph":7564},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕轻声发问。","sourceParagraph":7565},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「不再多补充一点内容吗。」","sourceParagraph":7566},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「表格没有多余的格子可以写。」","sourceParagraph":7567},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「之前你还在抱怨三行太短。」","sourceParagraph":7568},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼把笔帽扣上，发出一声细微的咔哒声响。","sourceParagraph":7569},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「现在刚刚好。」","sourceParagraph":7570},{"type":"paragraph","text":"个人陈述，远比简短的申请理由要耗费更多心神。","sourceParagraph":7571},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼前后打磨修改了整整两天。","sourceParagraph":7572},{"type":"paragraph","text":"第一版完整文档发送过来的时候，已经是夜里十一点四十七。","sourceParagraph":7573},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕已经躺到床上，手机在枕边轻轻震动。他睁开眼，伸手拿过手机，屏幕冷白的光映亮脸庞。","sourceParagraph":7574},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「帮我看一看。」","sourceParagraph":7575},{"type":"paragraph","text":"消息附带一篇文档。","sourceParagraph":7576},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕背靠床头坐起身，抬手揉了揉酸胀的眉眼。","sourceParagraph":7577},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「现在就要看吗。」","sourceParagraph":7578},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼回复：「如果你困，就留到明天。」","sourceParagraph":7579},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕瞥了一眼屏幕显示的时间。换作从前，他多半会硬撑着精神看完。此刻眼底的疲惫真切可感，指尖悬停在输入框，短暂思索。","sourceParagraph":7580},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那就明天再看。」","sourceParagraph":7581},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼：「好。」","sourceParagraph":7582},{"type":"paragraph","text":"没有纠缠，没有软磨硬泡，不会催促他连夜通读。","sourceParagraph":7583},{"type":"paragraph","text":"第二天下午，两个人坐在图书馆，一同审阅这份个人陈述。","sourceParagraph":7585},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嘴上说着让幕随意点评，旼内心实则紧绷。她反复翻动手里的书本，书页掀开一半便停滞，拇指无意识按压纸页边缘，视线却一次次悄悄飘向幕面前电脑的屏幕。","sourceParagraph":7586},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕读完开篇第一段。","sourceParagraph":7587},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「这一段的口吻，太像课堂汇报的发言稿。」","sourceParagraph":7588},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼立刻抬起头，手里的书本半摊在膝头。","sourceParagraph":7589},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「是哪几句。」","sourceParagraph":7590},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕把光标定位到对应的文字。","sourceParagraph":7591},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼低头细读，眉头蹙起。","sourceParagraph":7592},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「要直接删掉吗。」","sourceParagraph":7593},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「怎么反倒来问我的意见。」","sourceParagraph":7594},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「不然呢。」","sourceParagraph":7595},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我觉得可以删掉。」","sourceParagraph":7596},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼干脆利落地动手删除，仿佛早就等候着这句判断。","sourceParagraph":7597},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕继续向下浏览，读到中间的段落，停下滚动页面的动作。","sourceParagraph":7598},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼的身体不自觉微微前倾。","sourceParagraph":7599},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「怎么了。」","sourceParagraph":7600},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「这一部分写得非常动人。」","sourceParagraph":7601},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「具体是哪里。」","sourceParagraph":7602},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕轻声念出其中的句子：「我以前觉得拍摄是把东西留下来。」","sourceParagraph":7603},{"type":"paragraph","text":"紧随其后的一行：后来我发现，拍摄也可能只是陪一个东西待得更久。","sourceParagraph":7604},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕抬眼看向她。","sourceParagraph":7605},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你是什么时候萌生这样的想法。」","sourceParagraph":7606},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼的指尖搭在笔记本电脑的触控板上，指尖轻轻点触，光标却没有移动半分。","sourceParagraph":7607},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「剪辑心理中心那部短片的时候。」","sourceParagraph":7608},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「为什么会产生这样的感悟。」","sourceParagraph":7609},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那时候我总期待受访者，能够说出我预先设想好的回答。」她的指尖捻住笔杆转了半圈，又把笔按稳，「到后来才慢慢明白，他们本身流露出来的状态，就已经足够。」","sourceParagraph":7610},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕的脑海之中，浮现当初成片里面被删掉的那一句刻意升华主题的字幕：寻求帮助不代表软弱。","sourceParagraph":7611},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他轻轻点了点头。","sourceParagraph":7612},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼望向他。","sourceParagraph":7613},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你还记得。」","sourceParagraph":7614},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯。」","sourceParagraph":7615},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「怎么好多细碎的事你都记得。」","sourceParagraph":7616},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕稍稍一顿，若是放在从前，被这样评价，他会一时不知如何应答。此刻只是浅浅一笑，目光坦然地迎上她的视线。","sourceParagraph":7617},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「这一部分，我想要好好记住。」","sourceParagraph":7618},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼长长的眼睫垂落，握笔的手指安静停住，不再说话。","sourceParagraph":7619},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕继续通读全文。","sourceParagraph":7620},{"type":"paragraph","text":"文章的最后一段开篇写着：期盼去往陌生的环境，重新学习观察这个世界。","sourceParagraph":7621},{"type":"paragraph","text":"通篇读完，他没有立刻给出评价。","sourceParagraph":7622},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼克制不住心底的忐忑，指尖轻轻叩击桌面。","sourceParagraph":7623},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「怎么样。」","sourceParagraph":7624},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「对比第一版，进步很大。」","sourceParagraph":7625},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「最早那一版根本就不是现在的内容。」","sourceParagraph":7626},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「至少比你写在草稿纸上那一大段要好。」","sourceParagraph":7627},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼微微睁圆眼睛瞪向他。","sourceParagraph":7628},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕的眼底漾开一点小小的得意。","sourceParagraph":7629},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「整篇的完成度很不错。」","sourceParagraph":7630},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼依旧定定看着他。","sourceParagraph":7631},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「真的？」","sourceParagraph":7632},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「真的。」","sourceParagraph":7633},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「完全没有可以调整的地方吗。」","sourceParagraph":7634},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「非要我挑出一点毛病才行吗。」","sourceParagraph":7635},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「往常你总能找出问题。」","sourceParagraph":7636},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕略作思索，把笔记本电脑轻轻推向她这边。","sourceParagraph":7637},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「就是结尾的这一句。」","sourceParagraph":7638},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼垂眸看向屏幕上的文字：我希望这次交换能让我成为更好的创作者。","sourceParagraph":7639},{"type":"paragraph","text":"她盯着这句话看了许久，指尖悬浮在触控板的上方。","sourceParagraph":7640},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「这一句有什么问题。」","sourceParagraph":7641},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「读起来会有一点空泛。」","sourceParagraph":7642},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那换成什么样的表达合适。」","sourceParagraph":7643},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕轻轻摇了摇头。","sourceParagraph":7644},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我也想不出更加贴切的措辞。」","sourceParagraph":7645},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼眉头微微皱起。","sourceParagraph":7646},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「怎么连你也会说不知道。」","sourceParagraph":7647},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「确实没有头绪。」","sourceParagraph":7648},{"type":"paragraph","text":"她抿紧嘴唇，长久地凝视屏幕上那行句子，索性直接把整句删除。光标在空白的末尾处不停闪烁。","sourceParagraph":7649},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕本以为她会重新构思一句新的结束语。","sourceParagraph":7650},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不曾想旼直接按下保存，肩膀跟着松垮下来。","sourceParagraph":7651},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那就不额外写结尾了。」","sourceParagraph":7652},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「一篇文稿少了结尾。」","sourceParagraph":7653},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「上一句话就可以当做收尾。」","sourceParagraph":7654},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕向上滚动页面。","sourceParagraph":7655},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上一行文字写着：我想看看，在离开熟悉的人和地方以后，我还会看见什么。","sourceParagraph":7656},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕望着这行文字，心底泛起一阵轻轻的触动。","sourceParagraph":7657},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼微微朝他的方向侧过身子。","sourceParagraph":7658},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「这样不行吗。」","sourceParagraph":7659},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「可以。」","sourceParagraph":7660},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕把电脑推回到她面前。","sourceParagraph":7661},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「就用这个定稿。」","sourceParagraph":7662},{"type":"paragraph","text":"周末，开始整理项目的代表作品素材。","sourceParagraph":7663},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼重新导出心理中心的那部纪录片正片，内容不作任何修改，只调整视频的文件格式。","sourceParagraph":7664},{"type":"paragraph","text":"电脑开始渲染导出，两个人待在一间空置的教室内等候。","sourceParagraph":7665},{"type":"paragraph","text":"周末的教学楼格外清静，走廊尽头的窗户向外敞开，初春回暖的穿堂风缓缓流淌，教室的门板被气流拂得轻轻晃动。黑板上还残留着周五课堂没有擦干净的板书，粉笔碎屑积在讲台的边缘，午后的阳光斜斜照进来，可以看见空气之中漂浮着细碎的白色粉尘。","sourceParagraph":7666},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼坐在第一排课桌，双腿收在课桌底下，脚尖时不时轻轻磕碰桌腿。幕坐在她的身侧。","sourceParagraph":7667},{"type":"paragraph","text":"导出进度条停留在百分之三十七。","sourceParagraph":7668},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼的目光死死盯住屏幕上的进度，身体几乎纹丝不动，只有眼球跟着进度条一点点向右移动。","sourceParagraph":7669},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕开口轻声说道。","sourceParagraph":7670},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「就算盯着屏幕看，渲染速度也不会变快。」","sourceParagraph":7671},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「道理我懂。」","sourceParagraph":7672},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那为什么还要一直看。」","sourceParagraph":7673},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「害怕文件导出的时候损坏出错。」","sourceParagraph":7674},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「盯着屏幕，也阻止不了文件损坏。」","sourceParagraph":7675},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼侧过头望向他，眼神带着一点淡淡的嫌弃。","sourceParagraph":7676},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你今天话格外多。」","sourceParagraph":7677},{"type":"paragraph","text":"她把笔记本电脑朝自己身前拉近一点，手掌虚虚护在电脑的边缘。","sourceParagraph":7678},{"type":"paragraph","text":"进度条来到百分之四十二。","sourceParagraph":7679},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕陪着看了一会儿，忽然出声。","sourceParagraph":7680},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「如果真的申请交换成功，这台笔记本也要一并带过去吗。」","sourceParagraph":7681},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「不然呢。」","sourceParagraph":7682},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「整机的重量不轻。」","sourceParagraph":7683},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我自己背得动。」","sourceParagraph":7684},{"type":"paragraph","text":"两人同时短暂沉默，脑海里不约而同回忆起从前那一台沉重的摄影灯架。","sourceParagraph":7685},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼的唇角率先扬起，眼底漾开浅浅笑意。","sourceParagraph":7686},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕抢先开口：「我可没有说要帮你背。」","sourceParagraph":7687},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我也没有开口求你帮忙。」","sourceParagraph":7688},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「哦。」","sourceParagraph":7689},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼忍不住笑出声。","sourceParagraph":7690},{"type":"paragraph","text":"进度条缓慢爬升，百分之五十一。","sourceParagraph":7691},{"type":"paragraph","text":"走廊外面有路人经过，脚步声从一头传到另一头，之后慢慢消散。","sourceParagraph":7692},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼忽然开口：「昨天晚上，我跟我妈妈说了交换这件事。」","sourceParagraph":7693},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕转头看向她。","sourceParagraph":7694},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「阿姨是怎么说的。」","sourceParagraph":7695},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「第一句问我生活费够不够用。」","sourceParagraph":7696},{"type":"paragraph","text":"完全符合她母亲一贯的关切方式，幕不由得轻轻笑了，肩膀松弛下来。","sourceParagraph":7697},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「之后呢。」","sourceParagraph":7698},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「她说，如果我真心想去，那就去。」","sourceParagraph":7699},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「叔叔呢。」","sourceParagraph":7700},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「他翻遍了那座交换院校所在城市的地图。」","sourceParagraph":7701},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕脑海之中可以想象出那幅画面：核对地理位置，查询当地气候，规划从学校往返车站的路线。","sourceParagraph":7702},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「小野呢。」","sourceParagraph":7703},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼的眼皮轻轻向下垂落，神色淡淡的。","sourceParagraph":7704},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「小家伙说，终于没有人管着他了。」","sourceParagraph":7705},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕笑出了声。","sourceParagraph":7706},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「他倒是满心欢喜。」","sourceParagraph":7707},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「等我放假回家，得好好收拾他一顿。」","sourceParagraph":7708},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「别这样。」","sourceParagraph":7709},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我都已经盘算好怎么做了。」","sourceParagraph":7710},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕依旧带着笑意摇了摇头。","sourceParagraph":7711},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼安安静静望了他片刻，指尖轻轻叩响课桌的桌面。","sourceParagraph":7712},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那你呢，你有没有和谁说起这件事。」","sourceParagraph":7713},{"type":"paragraph","text":"脸上的笑意一点点从幕的眉眼间褪去。","sourceParagraph":7714},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「还没有。」","sourceParagraph":7715},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「为什么不说。」","sourceParagraph":7716},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕垂眸看向电脑屏幕，进度已经走到百分之六十八。","sourceParagraph":7717},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他的手掌放在膝盖上，指节缓缓向内收拢。","sourceParagraph":7718},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我不知道该怎么开口提起。」","sourceParagraph":7719},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「是对你父亲吗。」","sourceParagraph":7720},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯。」","sourceParagraph":7721},{"type":"paragraph","text":"短暂停顿，他又轻声补充了半句。","sourceParagraph":7722},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「还有她。」","sourceParagraph":7723},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼清楚明白这个指代指向谁。","sourceParagraph":7724},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「为什么一定要主动告诉她。」","sourceParagraph":7725},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕的喉结轻轻滚动。","sourceParagraph":7726},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「说不定之后她会主动来询问我的近况。」","sourceParagraph":7727},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那等到她问起的时候再说就好。」","sourceParagraph":7728},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯。」","sourceParagraph":7729},{"type":"paragraph","text":"晚风顺着窗沿吹进来，撩起旼鬓边一缕细碎的发丝。幕看了一会儿，抬起手，把那缕乱发轻轻拨回耳后。","sourceParagraph":7730},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼微微侧过脸，发丝顺着他的指尖滑落。","sourceParagraph":7731},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「又乱了？」","sourceParagraph":7732},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯。」","sourceParagraph":7733},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你最近总爱留意我的头发。」","sourceParagraph":7734},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕的手指停留在她耳侧，指尖距离发梢很近。","sourceParagraph":7735},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「不行吗。」","sourceParagraph":7736},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我没有说不行。」","sourceParagraph":7737},{"type":"paragraph","text":"她保持坐姿没有躲闪，幕的手指也没有立刻收回，指尖距离她的脸颊咫尺之遥。","sourceParagraph":7738},{"type":"paragraph","text":"整间教室太过安静，连笔记本电脑风扇运转的低沉嗡鸣，都听得一清二楚。","sourceParagraph":7739},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一个念头自然而然浮现在幕的心底，没有反复权衡利弊，不去考量应不应该，仅仅只是心底真切的渴求——想要靠近，想要吻她。","sourceParagraph":7740},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕缓缓把自己的手垂落，指背轻轻蹭过自己的裤面。","sourceParagraph":7741},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼抬眼望向他，两个人相隔很近，周遭一片寂静。","sourceParagraph":7742},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕的肩膀微微向前倾出去一小截，却在距离还差一点点的地方停住。","sourceParagraph":7743},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼没有躲闪，轻声发问。","sourceParagraph":7744},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你在做什么。」","sourceParagraph":7745},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕的耳尖迅速泛起热意，视线落在她澄澈的眼眸，声音压得很低。","sourceParagraph":7746},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明明已经距离这样近，他依旧还是吐出一句。","sourceParagraph":7747},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我不知道。」","sourceParagraph":7748},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼望着他，两秒之后唇角漾开浅浅的笑意。","sourceParagraph":7749},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你现在很常说这三个字。」","sourceParagraph":7750},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕被这句话冲淡几分紧张，浅浅地笑起来。身体没有以后退开，手掌撑在课桌桌面上，指尖距离她的手背只有咫尺的空隙。","sourceParagraph":7751},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「可以吗。」","sourceParagraph":7752},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼的目光落在他的脸上，轻轻点了点头。","sourceParagraph":7753},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯。」","sourceParagraph":7754},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕微微低下头。","sourceParagraph":7755},{"type":"paragraph","text":"这个吻落得很轻，只是嘴唇浅浅相触，旼的唇瓣带着一点微凉。","sourceParagraph":7756},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕本打算稍稍向后退开，旼伸出手，攥住了他外套的袖口。指尖先轻轻贴上布料，之后缓缓收拢力道，不会用力拉扯，只是把他留在原地。","sourceParagraph":7757},{"type":"paragraph","text":"第二次相触，停留的时间更久一点。","sourceParagraph":7758},{"type":"paragraph","text":"窗外的风穿过走廊，吹得桌面上摊开的申请材料边角轻轻翻卷。就在这时，电脑叮咚一声轻响，导出任务完成的提示弹窗跳了出来。","sourceParagraph":7759},{"type":"paragraph","text":"两个人即刻分开。","sourceParagraph":7760},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕以后稍稍退开一点。旼的手指依旧勾着他的袖口，迟迟没有松开。四目相对，片刻之后，旼低下头看向电脑屏幕，耳尖已经彻底染上一层绯红。","sourceParagraph":7761},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「完成了。」","sourceParagraph":7762},{"type":"paragraph","text":"她的声音比平日里要轻柔不少。","sourceParagraph":7763},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕的视线也落向屏幕。","sourceParagraph":7764},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯。」","sourceParagraph":7765},{"type":"paragraph","text":"两个人都没有主动提起刚才那一瞬间的温存。","sourceParagraph":7766},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼松开攥着衣袖的手指，指尖蜷缩着搁放在膝盖上。几秒之后，幕低声开口。","sourceParagraph":7767},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「这个弹窗，倒是挑了个好时机。」","sourceParagraph":7768},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼一下子笑出声，把头微微埋下，肩膀轻轻颤动，耳根的红色久久没有褪去。幕看着她，猜想自己的耳尖，想必也是同样滚烫。","sourceParagraph":7769},{"type":"paragraph","text":"距离申请截止还剩下三天，旼把全套材料收纳进硬质透明文件袋。","sourceParagraph":7770},{"type":"paragraph","text":"那天下午天气格外晴朗。连绵多日的阴雨彻底消散，天空铺展开淡淡的浅蓝。校园的宿舍楼楼下到处都在晾晒被褥，窗台挂满各色衣物。风褪去了冬日的凛冽，阳光落在肩头，已经带上融融的暖意。","sourceParagraph":7771},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕陪着旼走到学院办公楼楼下，来到台阶的底下，幕停下脚步。","sourceParagraph":7772},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼也随之驻足，双手把文件袋往怀里抱紧几分，透明的塑料外壳在明媚的日光之下反射出光亮。","sourceParagraph":7773},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你不陪我上去吗。」","sourceParagraph":7774},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「这份申请，该由你自己递交。」","sourceParagraph":7775},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「都已经陪我走到这里了。」","sourceParagraph":7776},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那又怎么样呢。」","sourceParagraph":7777},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「没什么。」","sourceParagraph":7778},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼低下头，指尖摩挲着文件袋坚硬的边缘。","sourceParagraph":7779},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕轻声发问。","sourceParagraph":7780},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「心里会紧张吗。」","sourceParagraph":7781},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「有一点。」","sourceParagraph":7782},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「会后悔吗。」","sourceParagraph":7783},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼迅速摇了摇头。","sourceParagraph":7784},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「不会。」","sourceParagraph":7785},{"type":"paragraph","text":"这一回她没有捻动袖口来缓解紧张，只是把文件袋抱在胸前，脊背挺得笔直，神色沉静安然。","sourceParagraph":7786},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那就上去吧。」","sourceParagraph":7787},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼轻轻点头。","sourceParagraph":7788},{"type":"paragraph","text":"迈上两级台阶，她忽然猛地回过头。","sourceParagraph":7789},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕还站在原地，一只手揣在外套口袋，另一只手自然垂落，抬眼望向台阶上方的她。","sourceParagraph":7790},{"type":"paragraph","text":"她开口唤道。","sourceParagraph":7791},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「幕。」","sourceParagraph":7792},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯。」","sourceParagraph":7793},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我是真的想去。」","sourceParagraph":7794},{"type":"paragraph","text":"就算已经听过许多次，当纸质的材料即将上交，这份心底的向往，又变得无比真切厚重。阳光落在她的发丝上，勾勒出一圈柔和的浅金色光晕。","sourceParagraph":7795},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕轻轻点了点头。","sourceParagraph":7796},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我知道。」","sourceParagraph":7797},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼却没有抬脚往里走。","sourceParagraph":7798},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕继续坦诚说出心底真实的感受。","sourceParagraph":7799},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「可我心里，依旧会舍不得。」","sourceParagraph":7800},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼的唇角缓缓扬起，眼底漫开一层柔软。","sourceParagraph":7801},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「这一点，我也知道。」","sourceParagraph":7802},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「但，是你自己选择奔赴向往的远方，并不是依靠我的成全。」","sourceParagraph":7803},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼轻轻摇了摇头。","sourceParagraph":7804},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕微微一怔。","sourceParagraph":7805},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「怎么了。」","sourceParagraph":7806},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「不是你的成全，才让我去的。」她语气平静而笃定，「是我自己内心想要奔赴。」","sourceParagraph":7807},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕安静片刻，而后释然地笑起来。","sourceParagraph":7808},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「说得对。」","sourceParagraph":7809},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼也漾开一抹浅浅笑意，这一次，不再回头，转身登上台阶，迈步走进办公楼的玻璃门，身影转瞬消失在走廊深处。","sourceParagraph":7810},{"type":"paragraph","text":"约莫二十分钟之后，旼从办公楼走了出来。","sourceParagraph":7811},{"type":"paragraph","text":"双手空空如也，那只文件袋已经不在手上。","sourceParagraph":7812},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕一眼就捕捉到这个变化，心底漫上来一种难以言说的滋味：有某样切实的东西已经交付出去。以后结果尚不可知，一切依旧悬置在遥远的未来。","sourceParagraph":7813},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼一步步走下台阶，站到他的面前。","sourceParagraph":7814},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕开口问道。","sourceParagraph":7815},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「全部递交完毕了？」","sourceParagraph":7816},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯。」","sourceParagraph":7817},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「接下来呢。」","sourceParagraph":7818},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「只能够等待评审结果。」","sourceParagraph":7819},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕的眉头微微蹙起。","sourceParagraph":7820},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼看见了，抬手在他眉心的前方虚虚比划了一下。","sourceParagraph":7821},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「又不喜欢等待这件事？」","sourceParagraph":7822},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你怎么看出来。」","sourceParagraph":7823},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「一碰到悬而未决的事情，你就会皱眉头。」","sourceParagraph":7824},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕舒展眉心，浅浅笑了笑。","sourceParagraph":7825},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「确实会有一点。」","sourceParagraph":7826},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那现在打算怎么办。」","sourceParagraph":7827},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕稍稍思索，这一回，他没有再说出那句「不知道」。","sourceParagraph":7828},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他伸出自己的手。","sourceParagraph":7829},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼垂眸看了一眼，把手放进他的掌心。幕稳稳地握住，她的指尖在他掌心里轻轻动了动，之后便安安静静地停下。","sourceParagraph":7830},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那就，我们一起等。」","sourceParagraph":7831},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼的眼眸弯成柔和的月牙。","sourceParagraph":7832},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「哦。」","sourceParagraph":7833},{"type":"paragraph","text":"两人并肩朝着图书馆的方向缓步走去。道路两旁的树木萌发鲜嫩的新绿，春风拂过细弱的枝条，枝叶在头顶轻轻摇晃，发出细碎沙沙的轻响。","sourceParagraph":7834},{"type":"paragraph","text":"路过便利店，旼忽然停下脚步。","sourceParagraph":7835},{"type":"paragraph","text":"被牵住的幕也随之驻足，回过头看向她。","sourceParagraph":7836},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「要不要吃冰淇淋。」","sourceParagraph":7837},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕抬眼望向外面的气温。","sourceParagraph":7838},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「现在？」","sourceParagraph":7839},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯。」","sourceParagraph":7840},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「气温还没有彻底回暖。」","sourceParagraph":7841},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那你不吃吗。」","sourceParagraph":7842},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕略作思量。","sourceParagraph":7843},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「吃。」","sourceParagraph":7844},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼走进店里，买回来两支冰淇淋，出来之后递到他手里一支，是很普通的香草口味。","sourceParagraph":7845},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕撕开包装，咬下一口，彻骨的寒意直扑牙床，不由得皱起眉眼，嘴角向下垮了一点。","sourceParagraph":7846},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼望向他。","sourceParagraph":7847},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「不好吃？」","sourceParagraph":7848},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕轻轻摇头。","sourceParagraph":7849},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「就是太冰。」","sourceParagraph":7850},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那别吃了。」","sourceParagraph":7851},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕又咬下一小口，像是不愿意白白浪费。","sourceParagraph":7852},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「都已经买好了。」","sourceParagraph":7853},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼安安静静看着他。","sourceParagraph":7854},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕低头盯着手里的冰淇淋，那句「买了就不要浪费」已经涌到嘴边，顿了顿，他把冰淇淋递向旼。","sourceParagraph":7855},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你还要吃吗。」","sourceParagraph":7856},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼伸手接了过来。","sourceParagraph":7857},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我要。」","sourceParagraph":7858},{"type":"paragraph","text":"她两只手各拿着一支冰淇淋。","sourceParagraph":7859},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕微微抬眉看向她。","sourceParagraph":7860},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你不怕冷？」","sourceParagraph":7861},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「还行。」","sourceParagraph":7862},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕低低笑出声。","sourceParagraph":7863},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「又说还行。」","sourceParagraph":7864},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼抬脚，鞋尖轻轻碰了碰他的鞋尖，力道很轻。幕向旁边挪开半步，很快又跟上她前行的步伐。","sourceParagraph":7865},{"type":"paragraph","text":"两个人继续沿着道路往前走。","sourceParagraph":7866},{"type":"paragraph","text":"申请材料已然上交，最终的结果依旧遥遥无期。五个月的别离，还仅仅只是一种可能性。幕依旧本能地抗拒这种悬而未决的等待，也依旧会暗自设想，如果交换申请通过，以后该如何自处。","sourceParagraph":7867},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可此刻春日阳光正好，旼就行走在自己身侧，两支冰淇淋握在她的手中，其中一支，刚刚还属于自己。","sourceParagraph":7868},{"type":"paragraph","text":"并不是所有事情，都要急着讨要一个确切的答案。","sourceParagraph":7869},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕微微偏过头。","sourceParagraph":7870},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恰好旼低头咬了一口刚才属于他的那支冰淇淋，吃完之后抬眼望向他。","sourceParagraph":7871},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「这一支，比我手里的更甜。」","sourceParagraph":7872},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「明明是一模一样的香草冰淇淋。」","sourceParagraph":7873},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「味道就是不一样。」","sourceParagraph":7874},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「哪里不一样。」","sourceParagraph":7875},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼把那一支递到他的嘴边。","sourceParagraph":7876},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你再尝一口。」","sourceParagraph":7877},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕低下头咬下一点点，依旧是纯粹的香草味道，依旧冰得人牙根发僵。他细细回味片刻，眉头缓缓舒展开。","sourceParagraph":7878},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「味道是一样的。」","sourceParagraph":7879},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼微微皱起眉头。","sourceParagraph":7880},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「明明就不一样。」","sourceParagraph":7881},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕忍不住笑出声。","sourceParagraph":7882},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那就是你手上那一支更好吃。」","sourceParagraph":7883},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「本来就是。」","sourceParagraph":7884},{"type":"paragraph","text":"她把两支冰淇淋全都收回到自己手中，幕没有争抢。","sourceParagraph":7885},{"type":"paragraph","text":"路边的春风拂过新生的树叶，沙沙作响。","sourceParagraph":7886},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以后还有许许多多的未知，需要静静等候。","sourceParagraph":7887},{"type":"paragraph","text":"但是今天，不必急着奔赴答案。","sourceParagraph":7888},{"type":"image","assetId":"image29","sourceParagraph":7890},{"type":"image","assetId":"image30","sourceParagraph":7891}],"textChars":10501,"hanChars":8901,"imageCount":2}